      "summary": "Fix encoding and combining marks in Russian language sorting rules",
      "fullMessage": "Fix encoding and combining marks in Russian language sorting rules\n\n- Remove UTF-8 BOM from googleTtsForNvda/locale/ru/languageSort.json to prevent JSONDecodeError in voiceManager.py and pass build_i18n.py translation checks.\n- Remove diaeresis from ignoreCombiningMarks so that ё is not decomposed into е during Unicode NFD normalization, preserving its distinct 7th position in letterOrder.\n- Keep acute in ignoreCombiningMarks to ignore Russian stress marks (знак ударения) during alphabetical sorting.\n- Add a trailing newline at end of file to match repository formatting standards.",
      "sha": "ade924f",
